<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><NetworkLink><name>De Facto World Map (live)</name><open>1</open><description>Who actually controls territory, rather than who claims it, as of 2026-10. By Trevor Christensen, https://trevorc.com/projects/de-facto-world-map. Map data ODbL 1.0: borders © OpenStreetMap contributors (via Overture Maps), with Natural Earth and geoBoundaries; Antarctic stations from COMNAP, non-commercial use.</description><Link><href>https://trevorc.com/apps/de-facto-world-map/data/export/de-facto-world-map.kmz</href><refreshMode>onInterval</refreshMode><refreshInterval>86400</refreshInterval></Link></NetworkLink></kml>
